	<string>Amitia App 需要添加照片到图库</string>
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Amitia App 需要访问相机来拍摄照片和视频</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Amitia App 需要访问麦克风来录制音频</string>
	<key>NSUserTrackingUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Amitia App 需要跟踪数据以提供个性化体验</string>
